[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet lid.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891384\">1044B10</a></p><p>Position the fuel filter assembly in a\nvice fitted with protective jaws.</p><p>1. Undo and remove the fuel filter filter element.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034133.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit a new filter element.</p><p>Remove the fuel filter from the vice.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891384\">1044B10</a></p><p>Close the bonnet lid.</p>"]]